    "AVX-512 compilation does not establish AVX-512 runtime correctness or performance.",
    "NEON rank15 and prefix512 assembly retains the prior vector instruction structure; noisy host timings do not support a comparative speed claim.",
    "Clang23 diagnosed specialization-dependent unused fixture counters with assertions enabled. The affected declarations now explicitly allow unused specializations; warning checks remain enabled."
